        "node_id": "n_2_a623f3",
        "thought_text": "Thought-1 (revised): Identify the longest suffix that is lexicographically greater than its preceding character. Once found, determine the smallest character in this suffix that is larger than the character immediately before the suffix. Reverse the substring starting from the character just before the suffix up to the identified character to ensure the string becomes lexicographically smaller. If no such suffix exists, return \"NO\".",
